Fixed Mobile Scrolling Issue
Root Cause
Touch Gesture Blocking by CSS transform: translateZ(0): On mobile browsers (especially iOS Safari and mobile Chrome), applying transform: translateZ(0) or backface-visibility: hidden to scrollable containers breaks native gesture recognition and cancels momentum scrolling.
Scroll Trapping & Height Collapsing:
The outer page container had justify-center and the inner card container had overflow-hidden.
The panels had overflow-y-auto but only specified lg:max-h-[90vh] (which only applies on large screens). On mobile, the panels had no explicit height bounds, so the browser couldn't calculate scrollable overflow and the parent overflow-hidden clipped the page, making it impossible to scroll.
content-visibility: auto on mobile lists: content-visibility was causing mobile browsers to collapse intrinsic layout heights, breaking touch hit-testing.
Auto-Scroll to scrollHeight: When switching to Preview on mobile, an effect was scrolling to the very bottom of the document instead of the top.
What Was Fixed
Clean Native Touch Scrolling (index.html):
Removed transform: translateZ(0), will-change: scroll-position, and backface-visibility: hidden.
Configured touch-action: pan-y; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; for vertical pane scrolling and touch-action: pan-x for avatar horizontal scrollers.
Removed content-visibility: auto to prevent height estimation jumps.
Mobile Layout Flow (App.tsx):
Changed container from justify-center to justify-start lg:justify-center on mobile.
Changed modal card container from overflow-hidden to overflow-visible lg:overflow-hidden, allowing the mobile viewport to scroll naturally without scroll trapping.
Panel Mobile/Desktop Adaptability (EditorPanel.tsx & PreviewPanel.tsx):
Configured panels to use overflow-y-visible lg:overflow-y-auto lg:max-h-[90vh] pb-36 lg:pb-8. On mobile devices, scrolling now flows smoothly with native OS momentum, and the floating bottom tab bar never obstructs content.
Updated tab switching so switching between Edit and Preview instantly aligns the view at { top: 0 }.
